# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Live TQQQ price, proxied through this domain.
#
# Status 200 makes this a PROXY, not a redirect: Netlify fetches the Yahoo URL
# on its own servers and serves the response as if it came from trantofire.au.
# The browser only ever talks to this domain, so there is no CORS problem and
# the site's Content-Security-Policy stays at connect-src 'self'.
#
# This needs no build step and no serverless function, which means it works on
# a plain drag-and-drop deploy.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

/api/price  https://query1.finance.yahoo.com/v8/finance/chart/TQQQ?interval=1mo&range=max  200

# The same route for the two funds the Progress page benchmarks against:
# QQQ is the unleveraged Nasdaq-100, QLD is the 2x version of the same index.
# Both are read-only monthly history, used to answer "what if the same money
# had gone here instead". Explicit per-symbol rules rather than a wildcard, so
# this domain cannot be used as a general purpose proxy for anything else.

/api/price-qqq  https://query1.finance.yahoo.com/v8/finance/chart/QQQ?interval=1mo&range=max  200
/api/price-qld  https://query1.finance.yahoo.com/v8/finance/chart/QLD?interval=1mo&range=max  200
/api/price-upro https://query1.finance.yahoo.com/v8/finance/chart/UPRO?interval=1mo&range=max 200
/api/price-sso  https://query1.finance.yahoo.com/v8/finance/chart/SSO?interval=1mo&range=max  200

# Daily closes for the three funds the benchmark compares. Monthly bars only
# appear once a month has ended, which left the comparison waiting; daily data
# lets every buy be priced on the day it actually happened. Five years is
# plenty of headroom and keeps the payload small. Widen the range when the log
# outgrows it.

/api/daily-tqqq https://query1.finance.yahoo.com/v8/finance/chart/TQQQ?interval=1d&range=5y 200
/api/daily-qqq  https://query1.finance.yahoo.com/v8/finance/chart/QQQ?interval=1d&range=5y  200
/api/daily-qld  https://query1.finance.yahoo.com/v8/finance/chart/QLD?interval=1d&range=5y  200

# One canonical home: https://trantofire.au
# The .com and both www forms redirect there, so there is only ever one live
# version of the site and one address in search results. 301 = permanent.

http://trantofire.au/*        https://trantofire.au/:splat  301!
https://www.trantofire.au/*   https://trantofire.au/:splat  301!
http://www.trantofire.au/*    https://trantofire.au/:splat  301!

http://trantofire.com/*       https://trantofire.au/:splat  301!
https://trantofire.com/*      https://trantofire.au/:splat  301!
http://www.trantofire.com/*   https://trantofire.au/:splat  301!
https://www.trantofire.com/*  https://trantofire.au/:splat  301!
